Design for Refill strategy seeks to maintain the product in use for a longer time than normal. This strategy works well with products that have limited functional lifespan. When the same provider of the product or third-part providers provide the service of these components the business model is usually defined hybrid.  When the refill part is provided as a service the company has the opportunity to engage with the user once again, this represents a good chance to improve user experience (experiential marketing) both in physical stores or online (omnichannel strategy).